  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessories retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control to assuring that providing only the highest quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Chevy Colorado/GMC Canyon Crew Cab\nFeatures\nEffortless Setup: Compatible with 2015–2026 Chevy Colorado and GMC Canyon Crew Cab models, these running boards are designed for easy, bolt-on installation—no drilling or special tools needed.\nDual-Step Structure: Featuring a practical two-tier step design, these side steps make entering and exiting your vehicle simple for passengers of all ages. The elevated center section also makes it easier to access rooftop gear or load cargo.\nStrong Carbon Steel Build: Crafted from premium-grade carbon steel, these side steps are engineered to handle up to 550 lbs. Their tough construction ensures long-term durability and excellent resistance to bending or warping.\nSlip-Resistant Surface: Built with a perforated pattern, the step boards help drain water, mud, and debris, maintaining a clean and slip-free surface for added safety during wet or icy conditions.\nAll-Weather Protection: Finished with a textured, dual-stage black powder coat, the boards offer strong resistance to rust, moisture, and harsh weather—perfect for year-round use in any environment.\nProfessional installation recommended",
